<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier</p>
<p>league soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Leeds 0 Tottenham 0. Attendance 33,783.</p>
<p>Liverpool 5 (Fowler 1, 28, 77, 85, Bjornebye 45) Middlesbrough</p>
<p>1 (Fjortoft 75). Halfimte 3-0. Attendance 39,491.</p>
<p>Wimbledon 1 Holdsworth 85) Blackburn 0. 0-9. 13,246.</p>
</text>
